# 432 for a nick over Ergo's NICKLEN (32). NICKLEN is unknown before 001, so
# the padded form is cut to 9 characters, which any server accepts.
= nick aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
= caps multi-prefix
> CAP LS 302
> NICK aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :ergo.test CAP * LS :multi-prefix
> CAP REQ multi-prefix
< :ergo.test CAP * ACK multi-prefix
> CAP END
< :ergo.test 432 * aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa :Erroneous nickname
> NICK aaaaaaaa_
? notice The nick aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa was refused by the server; trying aaaaaaaa_
< :ergo.test 001 aaaaaaaa_ :Welcome to the ErgoTest IRC Network aaaaaaaa_
? registered aaaaaaaa_
